This launcher follows the minimal one-tap Android packaging pattern used by
YuKongA/ghostlock-app (Apache License 2.0).

The physical-P0 oracle under `exploit/vendor/root-my-galaxy` is derived from
BuSung-dev/Root-My-Galaxy-Payloads. Its imported snapshot is
`75bdeb2f4b1a2ca81ac78651168351297af67114`; the vendored engine files were
also verified byte-identical to upstream HEAD
`32e5a390e8094fd0d212ade094f2570d46253232`. It is distributed under the
vendored Apache License 2.0.

Substantial parts of the reliability and diagnostics layer are ported from
igorcv88/Root-My-Galaxy-Extended (`dev.busung.s25uroot`), which derives from
BuSung-dev/Root-My-Galaxy. Both are distributed under the Apache License 2.0.
Ported code lives under `dev.indevelopment.m3qroot.rmg` and carries its origin
in the file header. Ported so far: run history and log archiving, payload
verification, in-app update, boot-settle policy, and the in-app Wireless
ADB transport (local ADB client, TLS 1.3/SPAKE2 pairing, mDNS discovery,
temporary Wireless Debugging scope).

Reference: https://github.com/igorcv88/Root-My-Galaxy-Extended

Optional shell fast path uses RikkaApps/Shizuku-API 13.1.5 (`api` and
`provider` artifacts), distributed under the Apache License 2.0.

Reference: https://github.com/YuKongA/ghostlock-app
Payload architecture reference:
https://github.com/BuSung-dev/Root-My-Galaxy-Payloads
Shizuku API reference: https://github.com/RikkaApps/Shizuku-API
